2. Emergency priviledges are an abstract set of permissions separate from administrator priviledges and do not override existing priviledges.
3. only relaxed during Emergency mode.
4. yes, administrators must update credentials immediately before any futher operation, and it must happen right after Emergency mode ends.
5. only those delegated during Emergency mode. The ones delegated before Emergency mode can be expired or revoked by an administrator during Emergency mode.

