   - Clarification: Such requests must be held until Emergency mode is fully active, then processed in priority order according to Emergency mode rules: High-classification requests first, then Medium, then Low.

CONSTRAINTS
===========
- Role delegation must respect clearance constraints at all times, except during Emergency mode when mutual exclusivity constraints may be relaxed.
- Requests submitted by users must have classification less than or equal to the user's clearance.
- Requests are processed in FIFO order during Normal mode.
